sequenceDiagram
    participant ProducerService as Other Microservice
    participant RabbitMQ
    participant FileService
    participant S3Repository
    participant AWSS3 as AWS S3

    %% Step 1: Upload request event
    ProducerService->>RabbitMQ: Publish "upload_request" message<br/>with file metadata
    RabbitMQ-->>FileService: Deliver upload_request message

    %% Step 2: Generate pre-signed upload URL
    FileService->>S3Repository: Generate pre-signed URL for upload
    S3Repository->>AWSS3: Request pre-signed URL
    AWSS3-->>S3Repository: Return pre-signed URL
    S3Repository-->>FileService: Return URL

    %% Step 3: Perform upload
    FileService->>AWSS3: PUT file using pre-signed URL
    AWSS3-->>FileService: 200 OK — File uploaded successfully

    %% Step 4: Publish completion event
    FileService->>RabbitMQ: Publish "file_uploaded" event<br/>with file details
    RabbitMQ-->>ProducerService: Notify upload completion